WEBVTT

00:00:06.004 --> 00:00:07.074
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Remember, when you watch TV...

00:00:07.074 --> 00:00:09.344
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Turn on the lights and sit back from the TV!

00:00:09.344 --> 00:00:09.934
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:31.714
There must be some mistake. Sakaki, a spy?!

00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:34.484
Look at this file, Minamoto.

00:00:37.304 --> 00:00:40.134
It's a photo taken by accident by BABEL staff.

00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:43.044
He may be having a clandestine meeting
with one of the Normal People.

00:00:43.044 --> 00:00:43.974
Impossible!

00:00:46.774 --> 00:00:49.804
That's right. There's no way Sakaki would!

00:00:54.414 --> 00:00:57.314
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.584
Maji de ii kanji

00:01:00.954 --> 00:01:03.724
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:07.324
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:10.364
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:10.364 --> 00:01:11.534
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:12.804
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:12.804 --> 00:01:14.474
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:15.494
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:18.974
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:18.974 --> 00:01:21.414
Kokoro no limiter

00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:24.844
Tokihanatareta hora

00:01:25.244 --> 00:01:28.444
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:28.684 --> 00:01:31.554
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:01:31.854 --> 00:01:35.154
Real wo tsuranuite

00:01:35.154 --> 00:01:38.394
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:38.394 --> 00:01:41.334
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:01:42.464 --> 00:01:48.934
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:54.874
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:01:55.314 --> 00:02:01.704
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:02:01.914 --> 00:02:06.454
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:02:06.454 --> 00:02:10.554
We can try over the future world!

00:02:10.794 --> 00:02:11.154
Yeah!

00:02:11.894 --> 00:02:12.554
Saidai!

00:02:14.694 --> 00:02:15.924
Daitan!

00:02:32.114 --> 00:02:34.514
Wait! I haven't even said anything...

00:02:36.384 --> 00:02:39.354
But you were thinking it, right?
That the monster's come.

00:02:39.624 --> 00:02:43.614
I can read your mind. Why don't I read it now?

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:48.224
Oh, so someone stole the essay with ESP, huh?!

00:02:49.564 --> 00:02:51.834
Oh, and monsters shouldn't be born?!

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:55.334
Shoulda known I could never
get along with guys like you!

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:56.274
Sakaki!

00:02:56.874 --> 00:02:58.574
You're Japanese, too?

00:02:58.574 --> 00:03:02.564
You think preaching to me in Japanese
will get me to reconsider?

00:03:03.284 --> 00:03:05.214
You're psychometrist, aren't you?

00:03:05.744 --> 00:03:07.804
Of course you're good at fighting,

00:03:07.884 --> 00:03:10.084
seeing how you can read an
opponent's moves in advance!

00:03:10.654 --> 00:03:13.284
Maybe you want a piece of this too, kid!

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.524
Go ahead.

00:03:22.134 --> 00:03:26.124
When you touch me, you'll
know what's in my heart.

00:03:28.104 --> 00:03:30.834
Everyone carries weakness in their heart!

00:03:31.074 --> 00:03:33.774
The fear that someone's better than they are.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:37.474
Even when everything you do
is better than anyone else!

00:03:38.784 --> 00:03:40.214
You're not a child,

00:03:40.214 --> 00:03:44.624
so why don't you think about
others instead just yourself?!

00:03:45.224 --> 00:03:47.924
Well... When you put it that way...

00:03:47.924 --> 00:03:49.754
I guess you're right.

00:03:53.764 --> 00:03:57.594
He did that on purpose to
make me read his mind.

00:03:57.834 --> 00:04:00.204
Must be an esper researcher.

00:04:04.274 --> 00:04:06.764
Even though he's younger than me...

00:04:10.214 --> 00:04:11.514
22nd sense.
"Create a Learning Environment!
Minamoto's Been Gunned Down?!"

00:04:11.514 --> 00:04:13.354
22nd sense.
"Create a Learning Environment!
Minamoto's Been Gunned Down?!"
Sakaki can't be a spy.

00:04:13.354 --> 00:04:13.984
Sakaki can't be a spy.

00:04:13.984 --> 00:04:17.324
In any case, you will conduct
the investigation of Sakaki...

00:04:17.324 --> 00:04:20.484
Or, rather, Miss Sannomiya will.

00:04:21.124 --> 00:04:23.124
Have Shiho do it?!

00:04:23.124 --> 00:04:24.694
Please, Minamoto.

00:04:24.694 --> 00:04:26.454
I refuse!

00:04:27.164 --> 00:04:28.634
I trust Sakaki!

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:29.464
But Minamoto...

00:04:29.464 --> 00:04:30.464
I'll investigate Sakaki by myself!
But Minamoto...

00:04:30.464 --> 00:04:32.494
I'll investigate Sakaki by myself!

00:04:32.634 --> 00:04:35.804
And I'm convinced I'll find
him absolutely innocent!

00:04:35.804 --> 00:04:37.634
M-Minamoto...

00:04:38.574 --> 00:04:42.604
What?! Undress?!

00:04:44.714 --> 00:04:47.144
Well, I think you just have a cold,

00:04:47.284 --> 00:04:50.544
but I'm getting a little tingle
from my clairvoyance.

00:04:51.154 --> 00:04:54.894
There's nothing to worry about at this stage.

00:04:54.894 --> 00:04:58.554
Wh-What is it? Not something serious, right?

00:04:58.694 --> 00:04:59.854
That's it!

00:04:59.994 --> 00:05:04.594
I must thoroughly reexamine you to
discover this as quickly as possible!

00:05:05.734 --> 00:05:06.894
R-Right!

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:19.114
Don't lie! You don't need to undress.

00:05:19.114 --> 00:05:22.214
All he needs is to just touch you.

00:05:25.524 --> 00:05:27.114
You creep!

00:05:28.154 --> 00:05:31.054
Even you can't barge in during an examination!

00:05:31.124 --> 00:05:32.794
I can't ignore sexual harassment!

00:05:32.794 --> 00:05:34.164
Lighten up!

00:05:34.664 --> 00:05:36.934
Can he really be a spy?

00:05:36.934 --> 00:05:39.234
You have to do your job seriously, right?

00:05:39.234 --> 00:05:42.504
I am! My diagnoses are absolutely spot on!

00:05:42.504 --> 00:05:45.064
Anyway, come out with me tonight.

00:05:45.974 --> 00:05:49.844
I found a bar with a ton of cute gals there!

00:05:49.844 --> 00:05:52.474
I figured even you might want
to cut loose once in a while.

00:05:53.014 --> 00:05:53.984
Okay.

00:05:54.884 --> 00:05:59.544
I know, you'll just blow me off and say
you have to watch The Children, but...

00:05:59.654 --> 00:06:02.524
WHAT?! Wh-What did you just say?!

00:06:02.524 --> 00:06:06.824
I'm going. You don't have to go nuts over it.

00:06:27.514 --> 00:06:30.684
Ugh, I'm so sick...

00:06:30.684 --> 00:06:34.054
That's what I get doing this for a week straight.

00:06:35.924 --> 00:06:37.864
Yes! I am the king!

00:06:38.794 --> 00:06:41.734
Nothing especially strange has
happened over the past week.

00:06:44.334 --> 00:06:47.264
Sakaki, I trust you!

00:06:48.304 --> 00:06:50.544
Agh! What's that doing there?!

00:06:50.544 --> 00:06:52.404
Minamoto!

00:06:52.404 --> 00:06:53.674
You smell like booze and perfume!

00:06:53.674 --> 00:06:55.174
What's this card from an adult club?!

00:06:55.174 --> 00:06:56.844
You've got lipstick on you!

00:06:56.844 --> 00:06:58.914
Dinner was cold tonight!
Come home to us!
Where've you been every night?!

00:06:58.914 --> 00:07:00.314
Are you my wives?!

00:07:00.754 --> 00:07:03.184
It's for work!

00:07:03.184 --> 00:07:05.584
I don't like going out drinking every night!

00:07:05.584 --> 00:07:08.324
Grownups have all sorts of social obligations!

00:07:08.324 --> 00:07:09.324
Sure.

00:07:09.324 --> 00:07:11.724
I believe Mr. Minamoto.

00:07:13.864 --> 00:07:17.804
Sorry, but I'm using a clairvoyance protector.

00:07:18.034 --> 00:07:20.634
Don't peek into other peoples' minds, okay?

00:07:20.634 --> 00:07:21.794
Meaning...

00:07:22.844 --> 00:07:24.804
You're begging us to go after you for real?!

00:07:24.804 --> 00:07:26.974
Make him spill it, Kaoru! Shiho!

00:07:26.974 --> 00:07:27.674
Roger!

00:07:28.014 --> 00:07:31.244
You think some electronic protector
can stop Level 7 clairvoyance?

00:07:31.314 --> 00:07:34.614
Stop! This is a work-related secret!

00:07:34.614 --> 00:07:38.054
Scanning me will be a serious
violation of regulations!

00:07:38.584 --> 00:07:40.524
Having said that, good night!

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:54.794
Who's calling at this hour?

00:07:56.004 --> 00:07:57.834
Kaoru? What's up?

00:08:02.274 --> 00:08:04.714
Have mercy on me!

00:08:04.714 --> 00:08:07.414
What are you saying, you idiot?!

00:08:07.414 --> 00:08:10.284
We've been doing this for a week straight!

00:08:10.284 --> 00:08:12.054
My body can't hold out!

00:08:12.054 --> 00:08:15.294
This is different from all the other times!

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:17.994
Because this one's gonna be for
my impossible heart's desire!

00:08:17.994 --> 00:08:22.834
A group date with BABEL's lovely
esper receptionist team!

00:08:23.934 --> 00:08:26.734
I've waited six months to get
a dinner date with Doubleface,

00:08:26.734 --> 00:08:28.604
and they went and asked us out!

00:08:28.704 --> 00:08:31.674
It's either you and me both or it isn't happening!

00:08:32.374 --> 00:08:33.474
Please!

00:08:33.474 --> 00:08:35.314
I'll never get another chance like this!

00:08:35.314 --> 00:08:37.404
Right... I could play this another way.

00:08:39.184 --> 00:08:40.374
Sakaki, a spy?!

00:08:40.814 --> 00:08:43.584
No, he's just under suspicion for now.

00:08:43.584 --> 00:08:45.174
I don't believe he is.

00:08:46.154 --> 00:08:49.094
During the date, I'm going to get him drunk

00:08:49.094 --> 00:08:52.154
and I want you to use that chance to scan him.

00:08:53.034 --> 00:08:54.124
Natsuko.

00:08:55.164 --> 00:08:59.674
I'm sorry! I promise, I'll take you
out for dinner some other time!

00:08:59.674 --> 00:09:01.334
It's not that, Minamoto.

00:09:02.074 --> 00:09:04.044
The truth is, we also...

00:09:06.974 --> 00:09:08.744
He has to be hiding something!

00:09:08.744 --> 00:09:11.174
He may have gotten himself a girlfriend!

00:09:12.014 --> 00:09:15.254
You've got a thing for Mr. Minamoto, don't you?

00:09:15.254 --> 00:09:17.944
So we want you to help us.

00:09:19.124 --> 00:09:20.784
Those girls...

00:09:20.854 --> 00:09:22.084
What do we do?

00:09:23.194 --> 00:09:25.714
They'll be following you, won't they?

00:09:26.564 --> 00:09:28.194
You guys look worried.

00:09:28.664 --> 00:09:30.464
K-Kugutsu?

00:09:30.604 --> 00:09:34.564
Anything a humble puppet master
like me can do to help?

00:09:35.374 --> 00:09:37.104
That's right! You're a puppet master!

00:09:38.744 --> 00:09:40.104
We're home!

00:09:40.644 --> 00:09:42.514
Move it! Don't be late!

00:09:42.514 --> 00:09:44.374
Oh, my hair! Ow!

00:09:44.444 --> 00:09:46.474
Darn it, it's stuck!

00:09:46.984 --> 00:09:48.454
I'm home!

00:09:55.624 --> 00:09:57.054
What's he doing?

00:09:58.664 --> 00:10:01.924
Minamoto, aren't you going out tonight?

00:10:02.134 --> 00:10:07.064
No, I decided not to. Let's just watch TV tonight.

00:10:16.814 --> 00:10:19.144
This isn't Mr. Minamoto!

00:10:22.184 --> 00:10:23.514
A puppet?!

00:10:25.324 --> 00:10:27.324
The power to imprint a puppet with thought

00:10:27.324 --> 00:10:29.454
and manipulate it via psychokinesis...

00:10:30.324 --> 00:10:31.554
Mr. Kugutsu!

00:10:31.894 --> 00:10:33.924
You're a lifesaver, Kugutsu!

00:10:34.164 --> 00:10:39.034
Please, no need to thank me.
That was a piece of cake.

00:10:39.034 --> 00:10:40.594
Right, Moga-chan?

00:10:50.214 --> 00:10:51.414
I broke up with them ages ago!

00:10:51.414 --> 00:10:52.644
No way!

00:10:55.284 --> 00:10:56.254
Like hell he did.

00:10:56.254 --> 00:10:57.614
So not true.

00:11:01.924 --> 00:11:07.024
And so, here's to deepening the
relationships of us young staffers!

00:11:07.364 --> 00:11:10.024
Cheers!

00:11:10.734 --> 00:11:12.364
Okay, let's drink!

00:11:12.434 --> 00:11:15.374
Don't drink too much. You know
how you regret it afterwards.

00:11:15.704 --> 00:11:18.534
What, trying to be the good little girl here, now?

00:11:18.674 --> 00:11:20.574
Uh, not that. Today, we're...

00:11:20.574 --> 00:11:22.604
No, no! You've got us with you tonight!

00:11:23.044 --> 00:11:28.184
Um, I've always wanted a chance to
have a nice chat with Minamoto.

00:11:28.184 --> 00:11:29.944
Hey, Hotaru! You trying to pull an end run?

00:11:30.084 --> 00:11:30.684
Hee-hee!

00:11:30.684 --> 00:11:32.054
Don't just go "hee-hee"!

00:11:32.054 --> 00:11:33.654
I'm not pulling any end runs.

00:11:33.654 --> 00:11:35.924
Tonight does not bode well.

00:11:35.924 --> 00:11:39.624
So, a group date with an odd number of people?

00:11:40.194 --> 00:11:43.534
It's fine! I called another girl to come, too!

00:11:43.534 --> 00:11:44.524
Another girl?

00:11:45.134 --> 00:11:47.564
Sorry, I'm late!

00:11:48.304 --> 00:11:49.304
Naomi!

00:11:49.304 --> 00:11:51.604
It's okay, we only just started!

00:11:51.874 --> 00:11:53.904
You like 'em young, right, Minamoto?

00:11:53.974 --> 00:11:55.304
What are you implying?!

00:11:55.714 --> 00:11:59.314
So, it's true. Minamoto, you're a ped...

00:11:59.314 --> 00:12:00.784
No, I'm not!

00:12:02.384 --> 00:12:03.244
Well, Shiho?

00:12:04.784 --> 00:12:08.154
It's no use. Mr. Kugutsu's a high-level esper,

00:12:08.154 --> 00:12:11.054
so it's hard to scan him
with our limiters engaged.

00:12:11.694 --> 00:12:15.424
And we can't contact
Doubleface, either. Now what?

00:12:16.064 --> 00:12:17.034
Dammit!

00:12:17.264 --> 00:12:20.334
Minamoto's probably having a ball right now!

00:12:20.334 --> 00:12:22.034
Mr. Minamoto, you perv!

00:12:22.134 --> 00:12:23.074
Give it a rest.

00:12:25.574 --> 00:12:27.504
Mr. Tanizaki!

00:12:27.944 --> 00:12:29.844
The Children?!

00:12:29.844 --> 00:12:32.004
You weren't with him?

00:12:34.514 --> 00:12:35.914
Wait, Naomi!

00:12:36.284 --> 00:12:38.954
As your future husband...
I mean, as your guardian,

00:12:38.954 --> 00:12:42.424
I cannot allow a minor to
go on this sleazy date!

00:12:42.424 --> 00:12:45.884
I won't permit it! Office romances
are absolutely off limits!

00:12:46.294 --> 00:12:48.854
Enough already, you pervert supervisor!

00:12:49.434 --> 00:12:53.064
I told you, I'm helping Mr. Minamoto
on an important mission!

00:12:55.004 --> 00:12:56.404
Help Mr. Minamoto?

00:12:56.744 --> 00:12:58.574
Which means...

00:12:58.944 --> 00:13:01.034
Dr. Sakaki is a spy?!

00:13:02.274 --> 00:13:05.014
Minamoto insists it's not true.

00:13:05.014 --> 00:13:08.074
That idiot. Why didn't he tell us?

00:13:08.214 --> 00:13:12.744
He didn't want you getting
mixed up in a mission

00:13:12.824 --> 00:13:15.314
where he'd have to suspect his best friend.

00:13:16.224 --> 00:13:21.664
Minamoto was very firm in his
decision to handle this himself.

00:13:23.164 --> 00:13:25.254
The limiter release?!

00:13:30.404 --> 00:13:31.904
Kaoru, where are you going?!

00:13:31.904 --> 00:13:34.534
Dr. Sakaki's not a spy! I'm going to prove it!

00:13:35.674 --> 00:13:39.474
Minamoto said he wasn't, right?
Then he can't be!

00:13:43.554 --> 00:13:45.354
W-Wait!

00:13:56.464 --> 00:13:57.954
This dish is so spicy!

00:14:00.004 --> 00:14:01.834
You don't like spicy food, Naomi?

00:14:01.834 --> 00:14:04.174
Sorry, I'm afraid so.

00:14:05.944 --> 00:14:07.274
What's up?

00:14:08.774 --> 00:14:11.744
I gotta go to the men's room.
Hold down the fort, okay?

00:14:14.614 --> 00:14:16.644
You really want to peek in on him?

00:14:16.784 --> 00:14:18.514
Sorry! Please!

00:14:24.664 --> 00:14:25.294
What's wrong?

00:14:25.294 --> 00:14:28.024
Hotaru, transfer the image to Minamoto.

00:14:28.134 --> 00:14:28.994
Gotcha.

00:14:34.004 --> 00:14:36.134
The list of special espers.

00:14:36.234 --> 00:14:38.794
The reward will be as promised, correct?

00:14:38.904 --> 00:14:39.894
Understood.

00:14:40.574 --> 00:14:43.174
Sakaki... Why?

00:14:43.414 --> 00:14:46.904
This clearly proves that Shuji Sakaki is a spy.

00:14:48.154 --> 00:14:52.744
Now what, Minamoto? If you don't
arrest Sakaki quickly...

00:14:55.494 --> 00:14:57.824
No, something's wrong here.

00:14:58.124 --> 00:14:59.824
What on Earth is..?

00:15:01.694 --> 00:15:03.634
This dish is so spicy!

00:15:05.034 --> 00:15:06.794
You don't like spicy food, Naomi?

00:15:08.474 --> 00:15:10.264
He shouldn't like spicy food, either!

00:15:10.644 --> 00:15:15.834
What's wrong, Minamoto? If you
won't do it, then I will!

00:15:23.114 --> 00:15:24.384
Minamoto!

00:15:24.484 --> 00:15:25.814
Take good look.

00:15:28.594 --> 00:15:29.484
Puppets?

00:15:30.764 --> 00:15:32.554
Don't move, Kugutsu!

00:15:32.624 --> 00:15:36.584
You were the traitor all along! Why do this?!

00:15:36.834 --> 00:15:40.324
Sakaki would die a traitorous spy.

00:15:40.404 --> 00:15:43.994
And in that way, I would have my revenge.

00:15:49.514 --> 00:15:51.634
Don't tell me... Everyone here is a puppet?!

00:15:52.114 --> 00:15:54.604
Nowaki, call Naomi to us!

00:15:55.114 --> 00:15:56.604
Forget it.

00:15:58.624 --> 00:16:01.684
I already immobilized her with esper cuffs.

00:16:03.464 --> 00:16:07.624
That just leaves a Normal and two scanners.

00:16:08.034 --> 00:16:09.524
You lose.

00:16:10.434 --> 00:16:12.864
You're going to shoot me? I don't care.

00:16:12.864 --> 00:16:15.464
Because the "me" here is also a puppet!

00:16:17.404 --> 00:16:18.434
Inside!

00:16:22.744 --> 00:16:26.274
Where is the real Kugutsu? He must be nearby!

00:16:26.344 --> 00:16:29.344
It's no use! I can't see him from here!

00:16:30.254 --> 00:16:31.254
What's wrong?

00:16:31.254 --> 00:16:33.314
It's Sakaki's psychic waves!

00:16:37.324 --> 00:16:39.194
Sakaki! Are you all right?!

00:16:39.824 --> 00:16:42.564
No, but I'm still alive.

00:16:42.564 --> 00:16:46.194
Hurry. He shot me a while ago.

00:16:49.604 --> 00:16:50.974
What's wrong, girls?

00:16:51.044 --> 00:16:52.004
You heard it?

00:16:52.004 --> 00:16:52.874
Yeah!

00:16:53.814 --> 00:16:55.534
Call out to The Children.

00:16:55.614 --> 00:16:56.544
Huh?

00:16:57.014 --> 00:17:00.644
He's jamming communications,
but telepathy should still work.

00:17:01.414 --> 00:17:02.654
Minamoto!

00:17:02.654 --> 00:17:07.114
It's no use. Even if they came,
I don't have the limiter release.

00:17:08.094 --> 00:17:09.314
Why not?

00:17:09.394 --> 00:17:13.194
This mission was to suspect
and possibly arrest a friend.

00:17:13.634 --> 00:17:17.124
As their guardian, I didn't
want them getting involved!

00:17:22.374 --> 00:17:25.274
Aren't we always telling you to
not treat us like little kids?

00:17:28.514 --> 00:17:31.004
Because, whether we're adults or kids...

00:17:34.014 --> 00:17:35.714
we're still a team!

00:17:45.224 --> 00:17:46.964
You're right.

00:17:46.964 --> 00:17:48.954
I was wrong.

00:17:49.734 --> 00:17:51.194
If you'd be so kind.

00:17:52.404 --> 00:17:54.704
I'm glad you put it that way.

00:17:54.774 --> 00:17:58.034
Special espers The Children...

00:17:59.644 --> 00:18:00.734
Released!

00:18:01.314 --> 00:18:01.934
<<RELEASED>>

00:18:05.214 --> 00:18:07.874
Spies have no future!

00:18:08.614 --> 00:18:10.844
And we'll teach you that with our own hands!

00:18:11.154 --> 00:18:14.084
Right! BABEL's own gutter sweepers!

00:18:14.394 --> 00:18:17.294
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:18:18.064 --> 00:18:20.254
Now, fight by my side!

00:18:20.594 --> 00:18:21.624
Roger!

00:18:26.874 --> 00:18:31.604
So, you're still alive. I didn't anticipate that.

00:18:31.704 --> 00:18:34.194
Because of that, The Children have come.

00:18:34.274 --> 00:18:35.644
Hold it!

00:18:36.374 --> 00:18:40.544
PSYCHIC FISHERMAN'S THROW!

00:18:43.524 --> 00:18:45.214
Esper countermeasures?!

00:18:45.324 --> 00:18:49.554
Not just that! She's full of gimmicks!

00:18:49.554 --> 00:18:52.924
Because I put all of my love into her!

00:18:52.924 --> 00:18:53.864
Gross!

00:18:59.164 --> 00:19:00.334
Cosplay?!

00:19:00.334 --> 00:19:01.434
No!

00:19:01.434 --> 00:19:03.594
It's just dressing up!

00:19:04.044 --> 00:19:07.664
No matter how scaled up,
Moga-chan is dress-up doll!

00:19:07.744 --> 00:19:10.244
I can't just ignore that aspect of her!

00:19:10.244 --> 00:19:12.614
Go get them, Fully Loaded Grade Moga-chan!

00:19:12.714 --> 00:19:14.414
Yes, Master!

00:19:17.954 --> 00:19:19.644
There's more where that came from!

00:19:22.354 --> 00:19:24.294
Cut it out!

00:19:24.364 --> 00:19:26.524
Hang in there, Sakaki!

00:19:26.524 --> 00:19:30.064
I used my weak psychokinesis
to slow the bleeding,

00:19:30.064 --> 00:19:33.124
but the bullet's deep in
my cardiac blood vessels.

00:19:34.734 --> 00:19:36.964
You need to give me emergency
treatment, right here!

00:19:37.104 --> 00:19:40.004
If the three of you help, it'll be possible.

00:19:40.944 --> 00:19:41.804
Us?

00:19:42.444 --> 00:19:43.414
I screwed up!

00:19:43.514 --> 00:19:44.274
Kaoru!

00:19:44.884 --> 00:19:47.344
Yes, Moga-chan! Fantastic!

00:19:48.084 --> 00:19:51.054
Found it! I've confirmed the bullet's location!

00:19:51.054 --> 00:19:53.614
Transfer the image to Naomi.

00:19:54.394 --> 00:19:57.554
When I give the word, I'll stop
my heart for two seconds.

00:19:57.694 --> 00:20:00.164
Use your Pk to remove the bullet then!

00:20:00.264 --> 00:20:00.824
Right!

00:20:01.264 --> 00:20:03.124
Playtime's over!

00:20:04.334 --> 00:20:06.264
Moga, firing!

00:20:07.204 --> 00:20:08.864
Idiot.

00:20:11.974 --> 00:20:15.704
PSYCHIC ONE-SHOT KILL!

00:20:17.214 --> 00:20:20.644
Your esper countermeasures won't do much
against a real, live missile, right?

00:20:20.884 --> 00:20:22.044
I'm such a klutz!
Dammit!

00:20:29.294 --> 00:20:30.454
It worked!

00:20:30.964 --> 00:20:32.454
I'm saved.

00:20:32.694 --> 00:20:36.424
It shows that, when espers work together,
they can do amazing things!

00:20:36.834 --> 00:20:38.034
Sakaki.

00:20:38.034 --> 00:20:39.134
Let's get him to the hospital!

00:20:39.134 --> 00:20:40.394
Let's leave that to Aoi.

00:20:40.474 --> 00:20:41.364
Right!

00:20:46.474 --> 00:20:49.604
It's a shame you turned out to be a spy.

00:21:00.454 --> 00:21:02.354
Did that really happen?

00:21:02.424 --> 00:21:04.354
Of course it did!

00:21:04.464 --> 00:21:06.954
It happened back in Comerica?

00:21:07.094 --> 00:21:09.064
You really can't remember?

00:21:09.064 --> 00:21:11.554
I'm kidding. How could I forget that?

00:21:12.134 --> 00:21:14.974
But didn't what the girls said to you

00:21:14.974 --> 00:21:17.334
remind you of what you once said to me?

00:21:17.404 --> 00:21:19.034
You're right.

00:21:20.344 --> 00:21:21.844
You're not a child,

00:21:21.844 --> 00:21:25.474
so why don't you think about
others instead just yourself?!

00:21:25.814 --> 00:21:29.444
Because, whether we're adults or
kids, we're still a team!

00:21:32.554 --> 00:21:35.884
Man, you are gonna make someone a great wife.

00:21:37.694 --> 00:21:41.824
No! It's just a habit I have!
The girls like them like this!

00:21:42.634 --> 00:21:43.834
Yoo-hoo!

00:21:43.834 --> 00:21:45.524
Still alive, Dr. Sakaki?

00:21:45.634 --> 00:21:47.364
We came for a visit!

00:21:47.504 --> 00:21:49.474
Oh, kids! You came!

00:21:49.604 --> 00:21:52.834
By the way, how'd you know we were there?

00:21:53.474 --> 00:21:55.204
Elementary!

00:21:56.014 --> 00:21:59.674
I have a thousand ways to know where Naomi is!

00:22:01.384 --> 00:22:04.254
And you're about to tell me all of them!

00:22:04.754 --> 00:22:06.754
Oh, apple rabbits!

00:22:06.754 --> 00:22:08.454
They're cut really nicely!

00:22:08.454 --> 00:22:11.054
Can we eat them, Minamoto? Come on!

00:22:11.124 --> 00:22:13.924
Stop that! I made them for Sakaki!

00:22:20.774 --> 00:22:26.244
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:26.244 --> 00:22:26.504
Yeah

00:22:43.594 --> 00:22:46.824
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:48.564 --> 00:22:54.094
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:54.434 --> 00:23:00.604
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:23:00.944 --> 00:23:03.204
Koi wa chie no wa

00:23:05.484 --> 00:23:10.144
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:10.584 --> 00:23:15.454
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:16.124 --> 00:23:17.564
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:17.564 --> 00:23:17.864
Kyun kyun!

00:23:17.864 --> 00:23:18.864
Anata wo

00:23:18.864 --> 00:23:19.294
Bye-bye!

00:23:19.294 --> 00:23:23.024
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:23.164 --> 00:23:27.204
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:27.204 --> 00:23:28.604
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:28.604 --> 00:23:28.904
Kyun kyun!

00:23:28.904 --> 00:23:29.874
Anata e

00:23:29.874 --> 00:23:30.504
Hai hai!

00:23:30.504 --> 00:23:35.344
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:35.474 --> 00:23:38.244
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:38.244 --> 00:23:48.444
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:23:49.994 --> 00:23:50.824
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:50.824 --> 00:23:52.724
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:52.724 --> 00:23:52.964
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:52.964 --> 00:23:52.994
NEXT EPISODE
Welcome, fellow members of PANDRA!

00:23:52.994 --> 00:23:55.654
Welcome, fellow members of PANDRA!

00:23:55.764 --> 00:23:56.664
Major!

00:23:56.734 --> 00:23:59.754
I thought it was time to introduce you all.

00:23:59.834 --> 00:24:03.204
To Kaoru Akashi, who will
one day be our queen!

00:24:03.334 --> 00:24:04.064
Queen?

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:05.604
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:05.774 --> 00:24:09.334
Episode 23: "Plot Twist! Stolen Away!"

00:24:09.474 --> 00:24:13.044
Kaoru Akashi! I absolutely won't
allow her to become the queen!

00:24:13.114 --> 00:24:15.014
Because the major belongs to me!

00:24:15.014 --> 00:24:15.314
Plot Twist!
Stolen Away!
Because the major belongs to me!

00:24:15.314 --> 00:24:15.514
Plot Twist!
Stolen Away!

00:24:15.514 --> 00:24:17.524
Plot Twist!
Stolen Away!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:17.524 --> 00:24:20.044
Plot Twist!
Stolen Away!
